%[text] ## <u>Theoretical ozone number density model:</u>
%[text] $N\_{O\_3 } \\left(z\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\Delta \\sigma\_{O\_3 } \\left(z\\right)}\\left\\lbrack \\frac{1}{2}\\left\\lbrace \\frac{\\partial }{\\partial z}\\left(\\ln \\frac{P\_{\\mathrm{off}} \\left(z\\right)}{P\_{\\mathrm{on}} \\left(z\\right)}\\right)+\\Lambda \\beta \\left(z\\right)+\\Lambda \\eta \\left(z\\right)\\right\\rbrace -\\Delta \\sigma\_M N\_a \\left(z\\right)-\\Delta \\alpha\_p \\left(z\\right)-\\left(\\sum\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\Delta \\sigma\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(z\\right)N\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(z\\right)\\right)\\right\\rbrack${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] $\\Lambda \\beta \\left(z\\right)=\\frac{\\delta }{\\delta z}\\left(\\ln \\frac{\\beta\_{\\mathrm{on}} \\left(z\\right)}{\\beta\_{\\mathrm{off}} \\left(z\\right)}\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] $\\Lambda \\eta \\left(z\\right)=\\frac{\\delta }{\\delta z}\\left(\\ln \\frac{\\eta\_{\\mathrm{on}} \\left(z\\right)}{\\eta\_{\\mathrm{off}} \\left(z\\right)}\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] $\\Delta \\sigma\_{O\_3 } \\left(z\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}: ozone absorption cross section differential
%[text] $\\Delta \\sigma\_M${"editStyle":"visual"}:  Rayleigh cross section differential
%[text] $\\Delta \\sigma\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(z\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}: absorption cross section differential of constituent ig
%[text] $\\Delta \\alpha\_p \\left(z\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}: extinction differential due to particles
%[text] $\\beta \\left(z\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}: bacscatter coefficient including particulate and molecular backscatter
%[text] $\\eta \\left(z\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}: optical efficiency including optical and spectral transmittance and geometric obstruction
%[text] 
%[text] ## <u>Practical DIAL model:</u>
%[text] Ignore particulate extinction and backcatter, as well as overlap function differences for now
%[text] $N\_{O\_3 } \\left(z\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\Delta \\sigma\_{O\_3 } \\left(z\\right)}\\left\\lbrack \\frac{1}{2}\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial z}\\left(\\ln \\frac{P\_{\\mathrm{off}} \\left(z\\right)}{P\_{\\mathrm{on}} \\left(z\\right)}\\right)-\\Delta \\sigma\_M N\_a \\left(z\\right)-\\left(\\sum\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\Delta \\sigma\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(z\\right)N\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(z\\right)\\right)\\right\\rbrack${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] 
%[text] Signal filtering: $S\_m \\left(k\\right)=\\sum\_{p=-n}^n C\_p \\left(k\\right)S\_u \\left(k\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] 
%[text] $z\\to z\\left(k\\right)\\;\\mathrm{for}\\;k=1,n\_k${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] $\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial z}\\left(\\ln \\frac{P\_{\\mathrm{on}} \\left(k\\right)}{P\_{\\mathrm{off}} \\left(k\\right)}\\right)\\to S\\left(k\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\delta z}\\sum\_{p=-n}^n C\_p \\left(k\\right)\*\\ln \\left(\\frac{P\_{\\mathrm{on}} \\left(k+p\\right)}{P\_{\\mathrm{off}} \\left(k+p\\right)}\\right)${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] 
%[text] Ozone number density as a function of range bin:
%[text] $N\_{O\_3 } \\left(k\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\Delta \\sigma\_{O\_3 } \\left(k\\right)}\\left\\lbrack \\frac{1}{2}S\\left(k\\right)-\\Delta \\sigma\_M N\_a \\left(k\\right)-\\left(\\sum\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\Delta \\sigma\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(k\\right)N\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(k\\right)\\right)\\right\\rbrack${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] 
%[text] Ozone mixing ratio as a function of range bin:
%[text] $q\_{O\_3 } \\left(k\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\Delta \\sigma\_{O\_3 } \\left(k\\right)}\\left\\lbrack \\frac{1}{2}\\frac{S\\left(k\\right)}{N\_a \\left(k\\right)}-\\Delta \\sigma\_M -\\left(\\sum\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\Delta \\sigma\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(k\\right)q\_{\\mathrm{ig}} \\left(k\\right)\\right)\\right\\rbrack${"editStyle":"visual"}
%[text] 
